  "limits": [
    "sigma is unexplained variance from ONE event: it absorbs real per-reach differences (culverts, levees, the HAND reference error) and everything the model cannot see, so it is an uncertainty budget, not a mechanism",
    "this is not a probability of flooding and not a confidence interval on a measured quantity",
    "the forecast error curve is measured on this gauge's daily record, and is applied here to an hourly hydrograph",
    "replay mode carries no forecast uncertainty because the series is observed, so its spread understates what a live forecast would carry",
